  "details": "When an Udon Behaviour is _initially_ (in editor) disabled at the component level, its Update and Start events will be called anyway. Update will continue to be called until the component is re-enabled and re-disabled.\nNote that disabling an initially enabled component in Start will result in calling Update just once.\nRepro world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_82c3c7b4-5b5f-4bd1-9c94-175a472771d4\nThe sphere's UdonBehaviour component is disabled in the editor. Its Start and Update events will log the component enable state, and also cause the material color to pulse. Clicking the cube will toggle the enabled state of the sphere's UdonBehaviour.",
